-- Factor C: Chase–Lev LIFO-Owner / FIFO-Thief Deque (`src/net.c` L193–L295).
-- Deque stored oldest-to-newest: thief steals head (`FIFO`, oldest independent subtree);
-- owner pushes/pops last or local end (`LIFO`). Work-stealing strictly conserves active redex count!
steal-fifo-step : List Word → List Word → List Word × List Word
steal-fifo-step nil          thiefDq = (nil , thiefDq)
steal-fifo-step (cons old r) thiefDq = (r   , cons old thiefDq)
